<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Italian first division</p>
<p>soccer matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Atalanta 2 (Morfeo 40th minute, Sgro 75) Napoli 2 (Aglietti 46,</p>
<p>Caccia 50). Halftime 1-0. Attendance: 18,000</p>
<p>Juventus 1 (Zidane 50) Bologna 0. 0-0. 45,000</p>
<p>Perugia 1 (Gautieri 33) Vicenza 1 (Iannuzzi 4). 1-1. 21,000</p>
<p>Piacenza 3 (Valoti 8, Di Francesco 43, Luiso 71) Milan 2</p>
<p>(Dugarry 46 and 68). 2-0. 16,000</p>
<p>Reggiana 0 Lazio 2 (Nedved 84, Casiraghi 90). 0-0. 10,000</p>
<p>Udinese 3 (Apolloni 64 - own-goal, Bierhoff 80 and 90) Parma 1</p>
<p>(Ze Maria 39). 0-1. 12,000</p>
<p>Verona 1 (Corini 69) Sampdoria 1 (Montella 51). 0-0. 17,000</p>
<p>Add first division summaries: Roma 3 (Balbo 16 - penalty, Delvecchio 72, Totti 88) Fiorentina 3 (Rui Costa 23, Batistuta 31 and 75). 1-2. 47,000</p>
</text>
